  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 3rd level, the conduit can spend a move action and concentrate on a single item or creature within 60 feet to determine if it is magical (as the base Divination sphere divine ability).</p>\n<p>At 8th level, this ability instead becomes constant, granting the conduit an automatic Spellcraft check whenever they come within 60 feet of a new magical source. Additionally, the conduit can detect a lingering aura for up to 1 day per conduit level they possess, regardless of the aura’s original strength.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/conduit#toc13\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
